  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\n<b>Weird RPG 2</b> is an innovative third-person action RPG.<p></p>\n<p>The combat system is built around parries, similar to <b>Sekiro</b>. The difficulty is lower than most Souls-like games, with no death penalties.</p>\n<p>Never tried <b>Sekiro</b>? Worried about its difficulty? This game is perfect for you.</p>\n<p>Already experienced <b>Sekiro</b>? Then the game’s innovative equipment system will be your perfect choice.</p>\n<p>The game focuses on monster hunting, looting, exploring maps, and boss challenges. A wide range of unique gear and items will bring you an extraordinary adventure.</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Transformation System</b> – You can choose to duel fairly with enemies or transform into an unstoppable force, locking heads with guns!\n</li><li><b>Parry Combat</b> – The core combat mechanic is parrying. The system has a friendly design with relaxed timing, letting players enjoy the joy of swordplay easily.\n</li><li><b>Voice-Controlled</b> – By using a microphone, you can control magic to attack enemies, offering a unique combat experience.\n</li><li><b>Unknowns and Challenges</b> – The game is full of unknowns and challenges! Encounter monsters of all shapes and sizes, with surprises waiting at every turn.\n</li></ul>\n",
